{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ortomnia is very early in Development, the Screenshots are mostly Placeholder and will be replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Demo for End of 2026 is planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ortomnia - Broken Trinity</strong> is a\u00a0 <strong>narrative 2D Action Adventure Boss Battler with Visual Novel Elements\u00a0</strong>in a <strong>hand-drawn cartoony style</strong> that takes place across <strong>various worlds</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <i>Keeper of the Worlds</i>, you must navigate <strong>challenging platforming passages</strong>, <strong>intense battles</strong>, and <strong>tricky puzzles</strong> to unlock the <strong>nonlinear stories</strong> of a diverse cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain access to their <strong>unique abilities</strong>, explore foreign worlds with a <strong>constantly expanding set of movement and combat options</strong>, meet various races, and uncover the mystery behind the creation of the galaxy to stop the rise of the corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And how exactly are the Divine Beings involved in all of this?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/extras/581bb219751133caef34599e9d03420d.poster.avif?t=1773313837\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/extras/581bb219751133caef34599e9d03420d.webm?t=1773313837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/extras/581bb219751133caef34599e9d03420d.mp4?t=1773313837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >action-focused, quick and responsive Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >story focused and intense boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >plattforming passages with tight and precise movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a narrative-driven experience with a strong character cast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a completely unique high space-fantasy setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exploring exciting and vastly different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a story full of mystery and tragedy to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rich and deep lore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/extras/2647d430119bb11417414ae0f1990c4b.avif?t=1773313837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/extras_big/2647d430119bb11417414ae0f1990c4b.avif?t=1773313837 width=800 height=166 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/extras/7ab1c0c0dd84b8c816aec92f3c358905.avif?t=1773313837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/extras_big/7ab1c0c0dd84b8c816aec92f3c358905.avif?t=1773313837 width=800 height=159 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501040?t=1773313837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/36ab5c60f2bd657a7693310bbe5eb2eac40f4bd3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773313837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/401678288fbe9c9ab14e0fb7bfef123830b1e515/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773313837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501040/401678288fbe9c9ab14e0fb7bfef123830b1e515/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773313837",